  "description": "How far down do you have to fall before there’s no coming back? For Seongcheol, rock bottom is a cramped apartment shared with Minho, a man whose \"love\" is expressed through bruises and cruel control. Just as Seongcheol surrenders to his grim fate, his past walks through the door in the form of Junseo, a former classmate turned detective. Junseo becomes obsessed with rescuing Seongcheol from his living hell, but breaking a toxic bond is never easy. As Minho senses his prize slipping away, his possessive rage triggers a dangerous, high-stakes confrontation. Can Junseo's fierce, protective devotion save Seongcheol, or will they all be dragged down by the heavy shadows of the past? *(Source: Lezhin US)*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/hkbh)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/recoil), [Spanish](https://www.lezhin.es/detail/vuelo-en-picada), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_11113463), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00551), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/gliding), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/hkbh), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/hkbh)\n\n##### Note: Winner of the 2025 Bomtoon Webtoon Contest. All official translations are uncensored, except for Japanese. This series is a global release, meaning all official translations come out on the same day as the original Korean.",
